Well, you need to install pygame. Ubuntu uses apt, correct? Try, (as  
root), "apt-get install python-pygame", or, as a regular user, "sudo  
apt-get install python-pygame". Or if you have Synaptic installed,  
you could just go the GUI route and use that. It's under some Gnome  
menu somewhere. I can't remember exactly where, but I think it's  
something like Desktop>Administration

